[00:01.30]1. O Jehovah, you have given us
[00:07.80]a hope that we hold dear.
[00:16.44]It’s a hope we find so thrilling
[00:23.42]we want the world to hear.
[00:31.66]But at times this life’s anxieties
[00:38.46]are the cause of fears within,
[00:47.06]And the hope that burned so brightly
[00:54.42]has suddenly grown dim.
[01:02.10](Chorus)
[01:02.10]You’re our strength, you’re our hope,
[01:06.00]you’re our confidence.
[01:09.70]Whatever we lack, you supply.
[01:17.42]When we preach, when we teach,
[01:21.28]we have confidence
[01:25.02]because it’s on you we rely.
[01:38.40]2. So Jehovah, please instill in us
[01:44.96]a heart that won’t forget,
[01:53.50]For you’ve always been our comfort
[02:00.94]when troubled times we’ve met.
[02:08.48]And these thoughts that lift and strengthen us
[02:15.70]can revive that dying flame,
[02:23.42]For they fill our hearts with courage
[02:30.98]to speak about your name.
[02:39.20](Chorus)
[02:39.20]You’re our strength, you’re our hope,
[02:43.02]you’re our confidence.
[02:46.94]Whatever we lack, you supply.
[02:54.52]When we preach, when we teach,
[02:58.40]we have confidence
[03:02.20]because it’s on you we rely.
